Package: SpatialOmicsMSI
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Spatial Mass Spectrometry Imaging Analysis
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("Spatial Omics", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Author: Spatial Omics Team
Maintainer: Spatial Omics Team <noreply@example.com>
Description: Function-first tools for mass spectrometry imaging import and
    validation, quality control, feature preprocessing, spatial graphs,
    spatially variable feature analysis, spatial clustering, region and niche
    analysis, subject-aware differential testing, ligand-receptor sensitivity
    analysis, pathway integration, visualization, and auditable export.
